Subject: [PATCH 2166/3799] soh: rename D_809070FC -> sSwordTrailAnchorOffset

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the hand-space point recorded as the sword trail's anchor at limbs 7 and 13; named for the trail it feeds, not from an identified model feature
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c      | 4 ++--
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2_data.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon2/z_boss_ganon2.c
